        "name": "Zap!",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Jinx uses Zapper, her shock pistol, to fire a blast that deals damage to the first enemy hit, slowing and revealing it.",
        "bodyHtml": "Jinx fires a shock blast that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/60/110/160/210 + (140% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the first enemy hit, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> them by 40/50/60/70/80%, and reveals them for 2 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Zap!'s cast time decreases as Jinx gains <span>Attack Speed</span>.</span>",
