        "bodyHtml": "Jinx fires a rocket that explodes on the first enemy champion hit, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(20/35/50 + (12% bonus Attack Damage)) to (200/350/500 + (120% bonus Attack Damage)) + 25/30/35% missing Health physical damage</span>, gaining damage over the first second of travel time. Nearby enemies take 80% Damage.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Missing Health damage cannot exceed 1200 against Monsters.</span>",
